            "name": "Jason"
          },
          "datePublished": "2025-11-29T19:15:00+00:00",
          "reviewBody": "Nice but very very expensive now !!!   😵‍💫😵‍💫😵‍💫",
          "reviewRating": {
            "@type": "Rating",
            "ratingValue": 2,
            "bestRating": 4,
            "worstRating": 2
          }
        },
        {
          "@type": "Review",
          "author": {
            "@type": "Person",
            "name": "Nadine"
          },
          "datePublished": "2025-11-28T19:15:00+00:00",
          "reviewBody": "Wonderfully presented with a cosy Christmas vibe. We didn’t realise we were seated outside and there was a cold breeze but under the heat lamps and with a blanket they provided we enjoyed the feeling of winter warm dinner. The pianist playing and singing Christmas tunes was incredible in fact my partner didn’t realise it was live because the singing was incredible. We enjoyed the ambience. All except outside meant smokers (vapes we don’t mind but smoke smell awful when trying to taste delicious food). So we moved inside to the bar for dessert. We were glad we did, had the sense of two atmospheres. Inside the bar was beautifully adorned, and cheery friendly staff. The piano was fully audible from there. It’s expensive but we knew that. That sticky toffee pudding was incredible. My son felt spoilt for his 18th with a birthday card and message on a plate with chocolate. Nice touch indeed. Will come back next year for sure at this time of year.",
          "reviewRating": {
            "@type": "Rating",
            "ratingValue": 4,
            "bestRating": 5,
            "worstRating": 4
          }
        },
        {
          "@type": "Review",
