            "name": "Mark"
          },
          "datePublished": "2025-11-22T17:00:00+00:00",
          "reviewBody": "First time here, my wife &amp; I loved it.\n\nGreeted with warmth, hosted by a very personable &amp; knowledgeable waiter and of course, the food &amp; drinks were excellent.",
          "reviewRating": {
