          },
          "datePublished": "2025-10-30T19:30:00+00:00",
          "reviewBody": "Disappointed with the service,  we felt quite rushed and the waiter would almost take things before we’d finished, food was good but the service spoilt our experience some what .\nWe were sat in the bar which didn’t help and the restaurant was pretty quiet with the main upstairs restaurant not very busy .\n\nWe went with very high expectations as we are fans of Richard Corrigan however we left quite underwhelmed !",
          "reviewRating": {
            "@type": "Rating",
            "ratingValue": 3,
            "bestRating": 4,
            "worstRating": 3
          }
        },
